@@ -867,6 +867,17 @@ config SPI_ROCKCHIP_SFC
 	  ROCKCHIP SFC supports DMA and PIO modes. When DMA is not available,
 	  the driver automatically falls back to PIO mode.
 
+config SPI_RAPUYAMA
+	tristate "Nokia RapuYama SPI controller"
+	depends on ARCH_RAPUYAMA || COMPILE_TEST
+	help
+	  Polled driver for the three SPI controllers of the Nokia RapuYama
+	  application ASIC (N8, E6, E7, C7). On the N8 the TI WL1271 WLAN
